ast your way through heart pounding shootouts. The environment pulses with beat of the music. Dodge bullets and shoot missiles out of mid air.\n\nPlay in \"Casual\" mode for a stress free experience, or play in \"Arcade\" mode with limited lives for big high scores!\n\nThe music and sound design for this game was done by Connor \"Singe\" Smith McCurdy https://allmylinks.com/singeofficial", "short_description": "Co-Op multiplayer classic arcade shooter. Blast your way through pulse pounding levels alone or with friends!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qJyUPkvAMjwRrYZxAVzWKY89XLSUnC-KRVxtLEzEXBM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Benjamin Parisi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.cybercadethevrgame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "246623914570826"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6224551647603266", "version": "0.0.11"}, "id": "812119756422735", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "